@startuml
title Prakriti Ayursensora — session lifecycle

skinparam backgroundColor #F7F6F3
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 14
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #243038
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontColor #243038
skinparam ArrowColor #5C6B73
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3D4A52
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 18
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E4EEF8
  BorderColor #2C5F8A
  FontColor #243038
  StartColor #2F7D57
  EndColor #3E5A70
}

top to bottom direction

state "IDLE\nWaiting for a person" as IDLE #E4EEF8;line:2C5F8A
state "INTAKE\nCode and consent" as INTAKE #E7F6F8;line:1C7C8C
state "PROFILE READY\nClinician confirmed the scores" as PROFILE #F1EAF8;line:6A4C9A
state "PRECHECK\nCups, media, exclusions\nIf checks fail, return to IDLE" as PRECHECK #F8F1D8;line:8A6A1F
state "RAMP IN\nPicture and music fade in\nMist is still off" as RAMP #E5F4EC;line:2F7D57
state "RUNNING\nAroma, display, and music\nfollow one plan" as RUNNING #E5F4EC;line:2F7D57
state "WIND DOWN\nMist off first,\nthen picture and sound" as WIND #E4EEF8;line:2C5F8A
state "ENDED\nLog closed\nReady for the next person" as ENDED #EEF2F5;line:3E5A70

state "PAUSED\nMist off immediately\nResume returns to RUNNING" as PAUSED #FBF1E4;line:B86A28
state "FAULT\nAroma forced off\nPicture and music may continue" as FAULT #FDECEC;line:A34545
state "SAFE OFF\nE-stop or power cut\nNext boot is IDLE\nMist does not resume" as SAFE #FDECEC;line:A34545

[*] -down-> IDLE
IDLE -down-> INTAKE : Enrol
INTAKE -down-> PROFILE : Answers saved
PROFILE -down-> PRECHECK : Start
PRECHECK -down-> RAMP : Checks pass
RAMP -down-> RUNNING
RUNNING -down-> WIND : Time ends
WIND -down-> ENDED
ENDED -down-> [*]

RUNNING -right-> PAUSED : Pause
PAUSED -[hidden]down-> FAULT
FAULT -[hidden]down-> SAFE
PAUSED -down-> WIND : Stop
RUNNING -right-> FAULT : Leak, empty cup,\nor lost heartbeat
FAULT -down-> WIND : End session
RUNNING -right-> SAFE : E-stop

footer Every ending comes back to IDLE. A mist session never restarts by itself.
@enduml
